IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g7-interpretation`
IMPORT `g7-commencement`
IMPORT `g7-vintages`
IMPORT `ind-b-tests-fixtures-g7`

-- ind-b-tests-commencement-vintages: independent tests of the commencement of Parts 3 to 6 and of the vintages that reach Articles 5 to 7 and 13 to 25
-- (group G7), by test author ind-b.  Every expected value comes from work/ind-b/expectations.md (rows C-01 to C-09 and V-01 to V-20), written before this
-- module's imports were opened.

§ `Commencement (rows C-01 to C-09, E13-49, E14-21, E18-19, E19-48, E21-30, E21-31, E23-12, E23-13)`

-- C-01, C-02: Part 3 (Articles 5 to 7) from 21 November 2014.
#ASSERT NOT `ind-b7 Part` 3 `is in force on` (YMD 2014 11 20)
#ASSERT `ind-b7 Part` 3 `is in force on` (YMD 2014 11 21)
#ASSERT `ind-b7 Article` 5 `is in force on` (YMD 2014 11 21)
#ASSERT `ind-b7 Article` 7 `is in force on` (YMD 2014 11 21)
-- C-03, C-04 (and E13-49, E14-21, E18-19, E19-48): Parts 4 and 5 from 1 May 2018.
#ASSERT NOT `ind-b7 Part` 4 `is in force on` (YMD 2018 4 30)
#ASSERT NOT `ind-b7 Part` 5 `is in force on` (YMD 2018 4 30)
#ASSERT `ind-b7 Part` 4 `is in force on` (YMD 2018 5 1)
#ASSERT `ind-b7 Part` 5 `is in force on` (YMD 2018 5 1)
#ASSERT NOT `ind-b7 Article` 13 `is in force on` (YMD 2018 4 30)
#ASSERT `ind-b7 Article` 14 `is in force on` (YMD 2018 5 1)
#ASSERT `ind-b7 Article` 17 `is in force on` (YMD 2018 5 1)
#ASSERT NOT `ind-b7 Article` 19 `is in force on` (YMD 2018 4 30)
#ASSERT `ind-b7 Article` 20 `is in force on` (YMD 2018 5 1)
-- C-05, C-06 (and E21-30, E21-31, E23-12, E23-13): Part 6 from 1 January 2019.
#ASSERT NOT `ind-b7 Part` 6 `is in force on` (YMD 2018 12 31)
#ASSERT `ind-b7 Part` 6 `is in force on` (YMD 2019 1 1)
#ASSERT NOT `ind-b7 Article` 21 `is in force on` (YMD 2018 12 31)
#ASSERT `ind-b7 Article` 21 `is in force on` (YMD 2019 1 1)
#ASSERT NOT `ind-b7 Article` 23 `is in force on` (YMD 2018 12 31)
#ASSERT `ind-b7 Article` 25 `is in force on` (YMD 2019 1 1)
-- C-07: all four Parts today.
#ASSERT `ind-b7 Part` 3 `is in force on` (YMD 2026 10 27)
#ASSERT `ind-b7 Part` 4 `is in force on` (YMD 2026 10 27)
#ASSERT `ind-b7 Part` 5 `is in force on` (YMD 2026 10 27)
#ASSERT `ind-b7 Part` 6 `is in force on` (YMD 2026 10 27)
-- C-08: Part 6 is not in force on 1 May 2018.
#ASSERT NOT `ind-b7 Part` 6 `is in force on` (YMD 2018 5 1)
-- C-09: Parts 4 and 5 are not in force on 21 November 2014.
#ASSERT NOT `ind-b7 Part` 4 `is in force on` (YMD 2014 11 21)
#ASSERT NOT `ind-b7 Part` 5 `is in force on` (YMD 2014 11 21)
-- The three stages, by the day the Table names.
#ASSERT `Commencement: the stage in which the unit was brought into force` (`a Part of the Law` 6) `ind-b7 A` EQUALS `stage 3: 1 January 2019`
#ASSERT `Commencement: the stage in which the unit was brought into force` (`a Part of the Law` 5) `ind-b7 A` EQUALS `stage 2: 1 May 2018`
#ASSERT `Commencement: the stage in which the unit was brought into force` (`a Part of the Law` 3) `ind-b7 A` EQUALS `stage 1: 21 November 2014`

§ `"Minister" text by text (rows V-01 to V-15)`

-- V-01: 2014-11-20, before the Law: no answer.
#ASSERT REFUSED `ind-b7 the Minister on` (YMD 2014 11 20)
-- V-03, V-04: Chief Minister to 30 May 2019; Minister for External Relations from 31 May 2019.
#ASSERT `ind-b7 the Minister on` (YMD 2019 5 30) EQUALS `the Chief Minister`
#ASSERT `ind-b7 the Minister on` (YMD 2019 5 31) EQUALS `the Minister for External Relations`
-- V-05, V-06: Minister for External Relations and Financial Services from 2 March 2021.
#ASSERT `ind-b7 the Minister on` (YMD 2021 3 1) EQUALS `the Minister for External Relations`
#ASSERT `ind-b7 the Minister on` (YMD 2021 3 2) EQUALS `the Minister for External Relations and Financial Services`
-- V-07, V-08: Chief Minister from 12 April 2023.
#ASSERT `ind-b7 the Minister on` (YMD 2023 4 11) EQUALS `the Minister for External Relations and Financial Services`
#ASSERT `ind-b7 the Minister on` (YMD 2023 4 12) EQUALS `the Chief Minister`
-- V-09: 26 February 2024: Chief Minister.
#ASSERT `ind-b7 the Minister on` (YMD 2024 2 26) EQUALS `the Chief Minister`
-- V-10, V-11: 27 February 2024 at 09:29 and at 09:30 (Jersey time).
#ASSERT `ind-b7 the Minister at` (YMD 2024 2 27) 9 29 EQUALS `the Chief Minister`
#ASSERT `ind-b7 the Minister at` (YMD 2024 2 27) 9 30 EQUALS `the Minister for External Relations`
-- V-12: 27 February 2024 as a date alone: no single answer (brief rule 5).
#ASSERT REFUSED `ind-b7 the Minister on` (YMD 2024 2 27)
-- V-13: 28 February 2024.
#ASSERT `ind-b7 the Minister on` (YMD 2024 2 28) EQUALS `the Minister for External Relations`
-- V-14, V-15: Chief Minister from 2 October 2026.
#ASSERT `ind-b7 the Minister on` (YMD 2026 10 1) EQUALS `the Minister for External Relations`
#ASSERT `ind-b7 the Minister on` (YMD 2026 10 2) EQUALS `the Chief Minister`
-- The 2025 Order inserting (ba), made 9 October 2025, "7 days after it is made": in force 16 October 2025.
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the day an instrument made on a day comes into force 7 days after` (YMD 2025 10 9) `ind-b7 A` EQUALS YMD 2025 10 16

§ `Article 2(1)(ba) by day (rows V-16, V-17)`

-- V-16: not in the text on 15 October 2025.
#ASSERT NOT `Endnotes: Article 2(1)(ba) is in force on` (YMD 2025 10 15) `ind-b7 A`
-- V-17: in the text from 16 October 2025.
#ASSERT `Endnotes: Article 2(1)(ba) is in force on` (YMD 2025 10 16) `ind-b7 A`
#ASSERT `Endnotes: Article 2(1)(ba) is in force on` (YMD 2026 10 27) `ind-b7 A`

§ `Reading checks for commencement and vintages (expected values from each reading's own words)`

-- F7.1 B (the whole of 27 February 2024 is in the new text): the date alone answers the Minister for External Relations.
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the office of the Minister on` (YMD 2024 2 27) `the interpretation with the other reading of F7.1` EQUALS `the Minister for External Relations`
-- F7.11 B (the day after the named day is the first day in force): Part 6 is not in force on 1 January 2019 on that reading.
#ASSERT NOT `Commencement: the unit of the Law is in force on` (`a Part of the Law` 6) (YMD 2019 1 1) `the interpretation with the other reading of F7.11`
#ASSERT `Commencement: the unit of the Law is in force on` (`a Part of the Law` 6) (YMD 2019 1 2) `the interpretation with the other reading of F7.11`
-- F7.2 B (seven clear days): the (ba) Order is in force from 17 October 2025 on that reading.
#ASSERT `Endnotes: the day an instrument made on a day comes into force 7 days after` (YMD 2025 10 9) `the interpretation with the other reading of F7.2` EQUALS YMD 2025 10 17
